      "description": "Eren`s rampage is thwarted by the War Hammer Titan whose tenacity leaves him stumped. With Marley`s military joining the fight, he`ll be hard-pressed to survive on his own."
    },
    {
      "episode": 7,
      "episodeNumber": 7,
      "title": "Assault",
